  "prefLabel": "Plc 901.03 Notifications; Issuance of Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 901.03 Notifications; Issuance of Licenses. The office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) shall send all notifications to applicants and licensees, and all licenses issued pursuant to this chapter, in accordance with Plc 301.03.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
